<style>
  .page-hero { background: var(--blush); padding: 56px 40px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .page-hero p.eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .page-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); font-weight: 300; }
  .page-hero h1 em { font-style: italic; }
  .page-content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 40px 80px; }
  .page-content > p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .page-content h2 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 300; margin: 40px 0 16px; }
  .page-content ol { padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .page-content ol li { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .policy-card { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 28px 32px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .policy-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .policy-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .policy-card ul li { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; padding: 6px 0 6px 20px; position: relative; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--blush); }
  .policy-card ul li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .policy-card ul li::before { content: '—'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gold); }
  .highlight-box { background: var(--blush); padding: 24px 28px; margin: 32px 0; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); }
  .highlight-box p { margin: 0; color: var(--charcoal); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .contact-cta { background: var(--charcoal); color: var(--white); padding: 48px 40px; text-align: center; margin-top: 64px; }
  .contact-cta h3 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .contact-cta p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .contact-cta a { display: inline-block; padding: 13px 40px; border: 1px solid var(--white); color: var(--white); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .contact-cta a:hover { background: var(--white); color: var(--charcoal); }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 40px 20px; }
    .page-content { padding: 40px 20px 60px; }
    .policy-card { padding: 20px; }
    .contact-cta { padding: 40px 20px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="page-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Melia Nae</p>
  <h1>Returns &amp; <em>Exchanges</em></h1>
</div>

<div class="page-content">
  <p>At Melia Nae, we want every customer to feel truly valued. We understand that sometimes purchases may not meet your expectations, and we're here to make things right.</p>

  <div class="highlight-box">
    <p>⏱ All exchange requests must be made within <strong>14 days</strong> from the date of purchase. Items must be returned in new, unworn condition with all tags, packaging, and receipts intact.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-card">
    <h3>↔ Exchanges</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>We offer exchanges within 14 days from the date of purchase.</li>
      <li>Exchanges can be made for products of the same price or greater. If exchanging for a higher-priced item, you will be required to pay the difference.</li>
      <li>All exchanges must be made at the original store where the purchase was made. If purchased online, contact us for instructions.</li>
      <li>Items must be returned in new, unworn condition with all tags, packaging, and receipts intact.</li>
      <li>If an exchange is not possible, we can issue a credit note for future purchases.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-card">
    <h3>↩ Refunds</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not offer refunds for change of mind or incorrect purchases.</li>
      <li>Refunds will only be issued if the product is faulty or has a defect that affects its use.</li>
      <li>Faulty items must be returned to the original store with proof of purchase for inspection and processing.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-card">
    <h3>✕ Non-Refundable / Non-Exchangeable Items</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>For hygiene reasons, earrings and personalised/custom jewellery are non-refundable and non-exchangeable unless faulty.</li>
      <li>Items purchased on sale or with a discount are final sale and cannot be returned or exchanged unless faulty.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-card">
    <h3>✈ Shipping Costs for Returns</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless the item is faulty or damaged.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2>How to Request an Exchange or Refund</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Email us at <a href="mailto:melianae@outlook.com" style="color:var(--gold);border-bottom:1px solid var(--gold);">melianae@outlook.com</a> with your order details and reason for the request.</li>
    <li>If eligible, we'll provide instructions for returning the item.</li>
    <li>Exchanges, refunds, or credit notes are processed within <strong>5–7 business days</strong> of receiving the return.</li>
  </ol>
</div>

<div class="contact-cta">
  <h3>Still Have Questions?</h3>
  <p>Our team is happy to help with any queries about your order.</p>
  <a href="/pages/contact">Contact Us</a>
</div>
